id:                     E1583
title: CMake4/Boost shim + gl4es 消费侧 + 未知平台 SONAME（coin3 4.0.7）
category:               compat, ohos, build-system, cmake, linking
severity:               2
phase: adaptation
last_updated: 2026-09-15

error_signature: find_package(Boost REQUIRED) -> Could not find a package configuration file provided by Boost; undefined glBegin/glEnd/glColor3f; libCoin.so 缺少 DT_SONAME

root_cause: |
  CMake 4.x 移除 FindBoost.cmake 且 conan boost 包无 BoostConfig.cmake；
  OHOS 无桌面 GL 立即模式符号（libGLv4.so 不导出 glBegin/glEnd/glColor3f/glVertex3f）；
  CMake 无 Platform/HarmonyOS 模块导致 -soname 链接标志为空。

rec_approach: |
  1) generate() 生成 BoostConfig.cmake shim（Boost::boost INTERFACE IMPORTED），
     Boost_DIR 指向生成目录；
  2) requires gl4es/1.1.6 并 headers=False + 清空其 cpp_info.includedirs，
     OPENGL_*_LIBRARY 指向 gl4es libGL.so，GL/EGL 头用 sysroot；运行期设
     LIBGL_GLES/LIBGL_EGL=/system/lib64 对应库并前插 LD_LIBRARY_PATH；
  3) cache_variables 注入 CMAKE_SHARED_LIBRARY_SONAME_C/CXX_FLAG=-Wl,-soname,。

match_keywords:
  - find_package(Boost REQUIRED)
  - BoostConfig.cmake
  - glBegin
  - glEnd
  - glColor3f
  - undefined reference
  - DT_SONAME
  - soname_gate_failed
  - CMAKE_SHARED_LIBRARY_SONAME

  - "coin3 4.0.7: conan-verify G0-G4+L2/L4/L5 全 PASS"
  - "CoinTests 327/327 通过（--report_level=detailed exit 0）"
  - "W3 build_and_test.sh 100% pass（L0/L1/L4/L5 全过）"
  - "test_package 场景图写回验证 exit 0"

rec_auto_fix:               false
rec_impl:               manual
rec_priority:               1
authors:               unknown
doc_file:               doc/E1583.md
